25,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We're wasting money on duplicate supplies, and the management office bills one person who then has to chase the rest of us.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes over an hour and a half. Also, an outside firm requires us to tidy up before they even arrive.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Some of us are barely here for weeks, yet the kitchen mess is mostly caused by just a few people.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,May,,"The bathroom grout gets dirty in less than two weeks due to ventilation. Plus, we all have different definitions of ""clean.""","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Midori,,Our arguments always start with reminders about chores. The previous tenants tried permanent assignments and ended up not speaking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if we have to tidy up for a professional, does that actually save us any time?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,Not much. We'd still be doing the surface work. It just shifts the deep cleaning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the billing issue is a symptom. The real problem is that the workload doesn't match the usage.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, if we can't even agree on what ""done"" means, no matter who does it, someone will be unhappy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Midori,,"Exactly, May. We need a system that doesn't lead to resentment or silence.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I'm concerned about the financial friction. Whoever pays the bill shouldn't be the only one managing the budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The time sink is significant. If we don't have a strict system, it's just a burden on whoever notices the mess.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,It's unfair for someone who is away for a month to have the same responsibility as a full-time resident.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,May,,And the bathroom is a losing battle if we don't have a standard. It's grim because the standards shift.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, but if we make it too complex based on usage, we might just fight more about the rules.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
