50,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option B is the most professional, but the billing process through one tenant is a headache we'd need to fix.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C is predictable. I can plan my week knowing exactly when the hour-and-a-half cleaning block hits.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option A is unfair if usage varies. Option C is better, but still doesn't account for people being away.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
