57,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Ryuji, that's the problem. Swapping leads to the same ""reminders"" and rows Midori mentioned.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,May,,"@Toshio, I agree. A professional service removes the argument over whether the grout is actually clean.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Midori,,"I think Option C is the safest for our relationships, as long as we agree on the ""done"" checklist.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
