62,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If we use Option B, the cost is shared equally regardless of usage, which is at least a consistent rule.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,May,,I'm leaning toward B. I can't stand the guessing game of the kitchen's state.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn, but if B stops the rows about chores, it might be the best for harmony.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I vote for B. It's the cleanest break from our current financial and social mess.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for B. My time is worth the monthly fee.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'll vote for B. It's the most logical way to standardize the result.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,May,,B for me. No more guessing.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Midori,,"I'll vote for B too, to keep the peace.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
